# Build logs
*.log

# AI model weights — pulled from the Hugging Face dataset at runtime
# (huggingface.co/datasets/Dedicatus/NeuraLink), never committed. GitHub also
# hard-rejects files >100 MB (the whisper ggml-base.bin alone is ~141 MB).
# Small bundled assets DO stay tracked: g2p_*.{txt,json}, bert_vocab.txt,
# se_*.f32 speaker embeddings, and the Kokoro/VOICEVOX vocab files.
*.gguf
*.onnx
ggml-*.bin

# Debug symbols inside prebuilt xcframeworks (e.g. whisper.xcframework ships
# ~66 MB of dSYMs) — only used for crash symbolication, not for building or
# linking. The framework binaries themselves remain tracked. 
# NOTE: 
# whisper's xcframework Info.plist had its `DebugSymbolsPath` keys removed 
# So the build doesn't require these ignored dSYMs (matches VOICEVOX). 
# If you re-vendor whisper.xcframework, strip DebugSymbolsPath again or commit its dSYMs.
*.dSYM/

# AI Agent files
RULES.md
SKILL.md
agents/
.cursorrules
.clauderules
.github/copilot-instructions.md

